# Purpose: Select the Japanese glossary rows, omit the locale column, and sort the term-definition export.
# Inputs: glossary/master.psv: pipe-separated locale, term, and definition rows.
# Outputs: exports/glossary-ja.psv: sorted Japanese term-definition pairs; stdout echoes the export.
accept master_path as text with default "glossary/master.psv"
run mkdir with flags ["-p"] and paths ["exports"]
run cat with path master_path
pipe to grep with pattern "^ja"
pipe to cut with delimiter "|" and fields "2-"
pipe to sort
then save to "exports/glossary-ja.psv"
